com,"$Starr hit a fly ball that looked like an easy catch for"
com,"Ellis but a gust of wind took the ball and it landed at"
com,"Delahanty's feet. Neither White nor Becker moved, thinking"
com,"the ball would be caught but when it landed safely, Becker"
com,"ran to second and White did not budge. Delahanty threw"
com,"home trying to throw out Graham. Phelps then threw to"
com,"second and Charles tagged both White and Becker who were"
com,"both standing on 2nd and were both called out"
